{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼私服／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーディガン used\nスカート used\nつけ襟は下北のどっかで買った！\n古着でクリスマス意識したよ。一応笑\nこの靴いっつも履いてるけど、\n楽なのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんみたいとか、\nクリスマスツリー風とか、\n君たち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せめてレトロだねって言って笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部お団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部リボン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"崩れんように必死だった笑\nくまでも○ッキーでもない、リボン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい久しぶりの握手会だったから\n緊張してしまったけど、\nやっぱ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会タノシー←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの家にお泊りする時\nとかってどんな話するの？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズトークしてはしゃぐ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年の手帳 買ったー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねと一緒におそろいの買ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コテ持っていますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそんな使ってない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってみたいAKBの曲って何?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンス激しいの踊りたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト3\nお団子"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルはとまとと一緒だったの。\nめっちゃしゃべったねー♪\n楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都全握だよ！\nライブあるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかと待ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/0095388/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}